description: BenchmarkDotNet conventions for MediatorLite.Benchmarks and MediatorLite.RestApiBenchmarks
globs: tests/MediatorLite.Benchmarks/**/*.cs, tests/MediatorLite.RestApiBenchmarks/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
